# Nominative and genitive singular.  A counted noun stays SINGULAR in
# Georgian, and the postpositions წინ ("ago") and შემდეგ ("after")
# govern the genitive -- "სამი თვის წინ" is three months ago.
# Declension table: en.wiktionary.org, თვე -- https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E1%83%97%E1%83%95%E1%83%94
თვე
თვის
